flowchart TD
    A[User submits idea] --> B[ChatGPT Idea Validator Skill]
    B --> C[Frame idea and assumptions]
    C --> D1[Market research]
    C --> D2[Competitor analysis]
    C --> D3[Customer research]
    C --> D4[Business analysis]
    C --> D5[Technical feasibility]
    C --> D6[Financial analysis]
    C --> D7[Devil's advocate]
    D1 --> E[Evidence audit and contradiction review]
    D2 --> E
    D3 --> E
    D4 --> E
    D5 --> E
    D6 --> E
    D7 --> E
    E --> F[Score viability and confidence separately]
    F --> G{Decision}
    G -->|Evidence supports MVP| H[BUILD]
    G -->|Demand unproven| I[TEST]
    G -->|Fixable weaknesses| J[MODIFY]
    G -->|Weak current case| K[REJECT]
    H --> L[Report and next steps]
    I --> L
    J --> L
    K --> L
